-- Narrative sequence is renumbered so the new events interleave with the v3.1
-- ones instead of being appended. Every event keeps a coarse year range, an
-- explicit reality label and an explicit confidence label; nothing is sharpened
-- into a date the sources do not support, and the primeval era carries no
-- historical years at all.

-- Step 1: park the existing sequences out of the way (UNIQUE is not enforced on
-- events.sequence, but overlapping numbers would still break narrative order).
UPDATE events SET sequence = sequence + 1000 WHERE work_id='10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005';

